{"id": "|47ADA33A4A81D9532E81F5988C958472", "source_en": "The Wards", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "الأقسام", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 35}}
{"id": "|D55CD41B49B77FAD8664C2B5FCF976F9", "source_en": "The art of the kill can be applied to a weapon with this resource.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "يمكن تطبيق فن القتل على السلاح باستخدام هذا المورد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 35}}
{"id": "|EEAB08EC40CBBF2495F344BB0605D23C", "source_en": "The cherished life essence of angels who trace their lineage to the almighty Divine. The Angelae, the first spawn of the New God, are inextricably linked with creation.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "جوهر الحياة الثمين للملائكة الذين تعود أصولهم إلى الإله القدير. إن \"الأنجيلاي\"، النسل الأول للإله الجديد، مرتبطون ارتباطاً وثيقاً بالخلق.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 35}}
{"id": "|5B328F6546C67307FB2EDA857259396D", "source_en": "The crystalized essence of a perished angel, sought after by demons to ascend their consciousness. Can be consumed by Nephilim to charge their own Angelic Grace.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "الجوهر المتبلور لملك ملاك هالك، تسعى الشياطين للحصول عليه لرفع وعيهم. يمكن للنيفيليم استهلاكه لشحن نعمتهم الملائكية.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 35}}
{"id": "|69979BF640C0E4E859B39DAB99F7EC69", "source_en": "The dust of mortal bones, useful to the keen eye as an invaluable ingredient in Alchemy. Can be used in crafting.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "غبار عظام الفانين، وهو مادة مفيدة للعين الخبيرة كمكون لا يقدر بثمن في الخيمياء. يمكن استخدامه في الصناعة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 35}}
{"id": "|E156AE2747B5601CD75E3D9243AB827E", "source_en": "The soul is irreducible, but by this currency it's scope may be expanded.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "الروح غير قابلة للاختزال، ولكن من خلال هذه العملة، يمكن توسيع نطاقها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 35}}
{"id": "|DFE2369D4741956A00FA44969227FE17", "source_en": "These scraps of ancient coinage may pass enchantments on to weapons and armor.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "قد تنقل هذه الشظايا من العملات القديمة تعاويذ إلى الأسلحة والدروع.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 35}}
{"id": "|E153D843447ECB03FB11C38C7BA0035D", "source_en": "This is a long message text that doesn't fully fit", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "هذا نص رسالة طويل لا يتناسب تمامًا مع المساحة", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 35}}
{"id": "|0071F8A34339DF396D924EA0E6BE04EB", "source_en": "This is the Library. Here you'll be able review found lore and unlock additional quests from Mereda.\n\nMereda will be vital in helping you uncover the mysterious events that precipitated the demonic invasion in Gildenarch, should you be interested.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "هذه هي المكتبة. هنا ستتمكن من مراجعة القصص المكتشفة وفتح مهام إضافية من ميريدا.\n\nستكون ميريدا حيوية في مساعدتك على كشف الأحداث الغامضة التي أدت إلى الغزو الشيطاني في قيلدنارك، إذا كنت مهتمًا بذلك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 35}}
